<!--
  Add these keys inside the top-level <dict> in ios/Runner/Info.plist,
  after running `flutter create`.

  NSLocalNetworkUsageDescription is required from iOS 14 onward for any app
  that sends/receives on the local subnet (our UDP beacons + TCP
  connections trigger the system's "Local Network" permission prompt).
  NSBonjourServices is only needed if you later switch discovery to
  NSNetService/Bonjour instead of raw UDP broadcast; left here commented out
  as a reminder in case that swap happens.
-->
<key>NSLocalNetworkUsageDescription</key>
<string>Link-Chat necesita acceder a la red local para descubrir e intercambiar mensajes y archivos con otros dispositivos conectados a la misma WiFi.</string>

